# `Print`

Top level method for printing results

**Package:** Core  
**Class:** Symbol  
**Aliases:** `Core$Print`  

## Description

The function `f` is responsible for printing the output prompt and for applying the [BeforePrint](../../Core/object/BeforePrint.md) and [AfterPrint](../../Core/object/AfterPrint.md) methods, if desired.


